        "DefaultText": "Wild Bees' Nest"
    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_wild_bees_nest",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_WildBeesNest_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A knot of grey paper comb wedged in a hollow, loud with wild bees. Smoke settles them, and the comb grows back after it is cut."
    },
    "CanBeRenamed": false,
    "AlternateNames": [],
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_wild_bees_nest",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_WildBeesNest_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Honeycomb:</b> Take the Comb gives 1 to 2 Honeycomb once the Comb bar is nearly full.\n\n<b>Stings:</b> Drag a lit Bee Smoker or a Lit Torch onto the nest to smoke it. The bees stay drowsy for about an hour and a half (the Torpor bar) and Take the Comb costs no stings. Take the comb with the bees awake and they sting you.\n\n<b>Regrowth:</b> The comb grows back in about 7 days and does not grow in winter."
    },
